(7335928, 1145234, 94815, '<td valign="top">An impressive, moody photo as close to kindred spirits as could be found in man and horse. So sorry it missed the "high contrast" aspect of the topic which might have ruined the shot; so just a 7 from me, but its a favorite for being as memorable as it is. I think it could have soared in free study voting.</td>', 'An impressive, moody photo as close to kindred spirits as could be found in man and horse. So sorry it missed the "high contrast" aspect of the topic which might have ruined the shot; so just a 7 from me, but its a favorite for being as memorable as it is. I think it could have soared in free study voting.', '2015-03-31 19:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7335929, 1145592, 94815, '<td valign="top">Contrast could have been stronger but. Still, the man teetering dangerously on the edge of the frame generates such tension that I can''t tear myself away.</td>', 'Contrast could have been stronger but. Still, the man teetering dangerously on the edge of the frame generates such tension that I can''t tear myself away.', '2015-03-31 19:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
