(7335942, 1145617, 40391, '<td valign="top">Wonderful confusion and excitement with this image even if the driver appears asleep.</td>', 'Wonderful confusion and excitement with this image even if the driver appears asleep.', '2015-03-31 21:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7335946, 1145623, 40391, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the dark shadows/reflections.</td>', 'I enjoy the dark shadows/reflections.', '2015-03-31 21:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7335947, 1145423, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. I like the use of shallow depth of field and enjoy coming up with different stories that may be behind this shot or that has nothing to do with it. Thanks to google I understand your title and yes, dog watching bike is quite appropriate.</td>', 'Lovely image. I like the use of shallow depth of field and enjoy coming up with different stories that may be behind this shot or that has nothing to do with it. Thanks to google I understand your title and yes, dog watching bike is quite appropriate.', '2015-03-31 21:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7335952, 1145425, 40391, '<td valign="top">Well beyond a photo. Such a beautiful image with so much to look at but two people worth studying. Im imagining theyre sharing a newspaper during a tea break after working in the yard in the rain thanks to the umbrella and gloves. However, the shoes defy this so Im still left wondering.<br/> <br/>I would have made a squarer crop and removed most, if not all, of the table and chair in the foreground. But, I also dont have the skill to create such an image in the first place so what would I know. I really enjoy this image, thank you.</td>', 'Well beyond a photo. Such a beautiful image with so much to look at but two people worth studying. Im imagining theyre sharing a newspaper during a tea break after working in the yard in the rain thanks to the umbrella and gloves. However, the shoes defy this so Im still left wondering. I would have made a squarer crop and removed most, if not all, of the table and chair in the foreground. But, I also dont have the skill to create such an image in the first place so what would I know. I really enjoy this image, thank you.', '2015-03-31 21:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7335953, 1145045, 40391, '<td valign="top">Im not much of a fan of this type of boarder but no matter how hard it tries, it cannot distract me from your wonderful image.</td>', 'Im not much of a fan of this type of boarder but no matter how hard it tries, it cannot distract me from your wonderful image.', '2015-03-31 21:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
